Error [E1308]: `run`'s parameter isn't a CLI-derived type
  --> tests/ui/retired_cli_marker.jet:5:14
    |
  5 | fn run(args: Args) {
    |              ^^^^
 Why: a typed `fn run(args: T)` entry only works when `T` is a `#[CLI]`-derived struct, or an `enum` whose every variant carries a `#[CLI]` struct payload.
 Fix: mark the struct `#[CLI]`, or give the enum's variants `#[CLI]` struct payloads
